  "context": "Found by the plan-privacy batch (PR #4054). Verification rubric: reproduce first; focused suites with -n 0; comment-policy and ruff; smoke recorded in the PR body; PR merged with green CI and passing oracle review. Guardrail: do not loosen the unknown-field check globally.\n\nBATCH DECISIONS (2026-11-09): lands FIRST. The loader (loader.py ~line 620) itself sets result['query_plan_raw'] and show_plan reads it, but the legacy-field contract in core/results/query_execution.py rejects it. Decide by evidence whether the contract should list it as a known field or the loader should map it, but do NOT loosen the unknown-field check for other names; an unknown-field regression test must stay. GUARDRAILS: stored fingerprints are never recomputed; never print leaked path values in diagnostics; do not widen the detector to every absolute path (owner decision 2026-11-08); fail-closed publish behavior stays; private non-anonymized exports unchanged; no hosted data deletion or history rewrite. Verification rubric: (1) reproduce with a failing test or script before editing; (2) focused suites pass via uv run -- python -m pytest -n 0; (3) make comment-policy-check and ruff on touched files; (4) the runtime smoke named in acceptance is recorded in the PR body; (5) one final batch PR merges with green CI and a passing oracle review.",
